  "name": "Multi-Key Auth with Rotation",
  "description": "Operators issue, list, revoke and rotate API keys without server restart, via CLI, REST and MCP. Durable hashed key store with expiry and a rotation grace period; auth middleware checks the store alongside legacy keys.",
